{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tikus Tales</strong> is a whimsical 3D platformer with a heavy focus on boss battles, starring two courageous mice, Suki and Tuki. When twelve rebellious animals stage a coup and imprison the Chinese Zodiac, only the mice manage to escape. Now, it's up to them to travel across a magical, Southeast Asia-inspired world\u2014jumping, throwing, and battling their way through diverse environments\u2014to restore balance to the Zodiac.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770880/extras/GIF_20250408_222241_179.gif?t=1744127696\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Tikus Tales</i> blends stylized low-poly visuals with fast-paced, lighthearted combat and creative platforming sequences. Each boss battle is a multi-phase showdown\u2014expect sudden twists like flooding arenas, chase sequences, and ever-changing rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770880/extras/GIF_20250408_221712_080.gif?t=1744127696\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With charm, humor, and a fresh twist on familiar legends, <i>Tikus Tales</i> offers a delightfully chaotic adventure full of surprises and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770880/extras/GIF_20250407_124951_026.gif?t=1744127696\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1770880?t=1744127696","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1770880?t=1744127696","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770880/bf04d4529e9fae25386f26b748a8c40e26043a21/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744127696","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770880/bf04d4529e9fa